{"mode":"words","text":"Od tu naprej je odvisno od tvojega učnega cilja. Če želiš jezik le razumeti, si že dosegel cilj – preprosto ostani pri korakih dva in tri. Če želiš govoriti, sledi govorjenje v zboru: z metodo ponavljanja A-B vzemi kratek stavek, nastavi hitrost na zelo počasno in govori hkrati z glasom – kot v zboru. Takoj boš slišal, če kaj zveni drugače, in se boš sam popravil. To lahko počneš kjerkoli, celo v tramvaju: s slušalkami zveni kot telefonski pogovor. Če pa se želiš naučiti pisati, preprosto prepiši besedilo stavek za stavkom.","words":[{"s":0,"e":160},{"s":240,"e":400},{"s":440,"e":720},{"s":747,"e":800},{"s":853,"e":1280},{"s":1333,"e":1440},{"s":1480,"e":1840},{"s":1920,"e":2320},{"s":2380,"e":2800},{"s":3240,"e":3760},{"s":3840,"e":4160},{"s":4213,"e":4560},{"s":4613,"e":4720},{"s":4760,"e":5360},{"s":5547,"e":5920},{"s":5973,"e":6080},{"s":6133,"e":6560},{"s":6640,"e":6960},{"s":7200,"e":7440},{"s":7500,"e":8000},{"s":8060,"e":8480},{"s":8520,"e":8640},{"s":8680,"e":9120},{"s":9200,"e":9440},{"s":9573,"e":9840},{"s":9880,"e":10160},{"s":10600,"e":11120},{"s":11160,"e":11440},{"s":11493,"e":12080},{"s":12208,"e":12800},{"s":12827,"e":13360},{"s":13400,"e":13440},{"s":13480,"e":14000},{"s":14440,"e":14880},{"s":14937,"e":15280},{"s":15340,"e":16000},{"s":16160,"e":16640},{"s":16853,"e":17440},{"s":17520,"e":17920},{"s":17973,"e":18480},{"s":18624,"e":19440},{"s":19480,"e":19920},{"s":19973,"e":20080},{"s":20120,"e":20320},{"s":20373,"e":21120},{"s":21307,"e":21680},{"s":21720,"e":22000},{"s":22080,"e":22560},{"s":22600,"e":22640},{"s":22667,"e":23120},{"s":23400,"e":23680},{"s":23720,"e":23840},{"s":23880,"e":23920},{"s":24000,"e":24480},{"s":24720,"e":25600},{"s":25627,"e":25760},{"s":25800,"e":26320},{"s":26373,"e":26480},{"s":26520,"e":26720},{"s":26760,"e":26960},{"s":27024,"e":27920},{"s":28000,"e":28160},{"s":28213,"e":28320},{"s":28373,"e":28560},{"s":28620,"e":28800},{"s":28840,"e":29880},{"s":30053,"e":30400},{"s":30440,"e":30720},{"